  "content": "\n\n![原始邊境](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336081/description_51676466-6665-45e8-9ac8-27d2774e0614.png)\n\n## 此模組需要 **[Geckolib](https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib)**\n本專案目前處於非常早期的開發階段，敬請預期會有錯誤與未完成的功能！</strong></em></span></p>\n\n***\n\n### 關於原始邊境\n\n原始邊境（Primal Frontier）是一款旨在為主世界增添有趣且獨特玩法的模組，透過復活史前生物並賦予牠們各自獨特的能力與弱點來實現。你可以選擇將牠們視為威脅，或是馴服牠們並將牠們的能力化為己用！\n\n目前此模組僅包含 2 種生物，但隨著模組不斷成長，\n未來將加入更多擁有獨特功能、用途與玩法的生物。\n\n<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>觀看我們近期的影片，學習如何馴服屬於你自己的蟻獅！</strong></span>\n<iframe width=\"280\" height=\"157\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oZ_vExPoFTc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">加入<span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/WYBvB6fWXx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Discord</span></a></span> 伺服器以獲取最新資訊，並透過建議、投票以及關於未來更新和開發進度的提問來參與開發！</h2><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>感謝所有透過創作內容支持我們的人！</strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>劇透</summary>\n  <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/DRekrpO7Bfg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jXX50kTdF2I\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/agqO6Kc-LjU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>製作人員：</strong></span></h1>\n\n<details>\n<summary>劇透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><hr><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>程式設計師：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo</pre><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>動畫師：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo</pre><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>3D 美術：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo, duoud23, Sr.Mono</pre>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>2D 美術：\n</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Allims2009</pre><hr><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p></div>\n\n</details>",
